    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your magical smite now radiates protective energy. Whenever you cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplDivineSmit]{Divine Smite}, you and your allies have Half Cover while in your Aura of Protection. The aura has this benefit until the start of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-zaNpOup6oPMC6RtV\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which provides the Half Cover status but it is not automatically granted as creatures enter/exit your aura.</p></section>",
